# Visual Design Taste

Whenever building, designing, or reviewing any UI, layout, component, page, or visual artifact for this project, **read and strictly follow** the taste skill at `.cursor/skills/taste.md`.

## Desktop grid spec

Always use these values when building page layouts. They are defined as CSS variables in `globals.css` and exposed as Tailwind utilities.

| Property | Value | Tailwind class |
|---|---|---|
| Columns | 24 | `grid-cols-24` |
| Margin (container padding) | 20px | `px-[20px]` via `<Container>` |
| Gutter (column gap) | 8px | `gap-[8px]` via `<Grid>` |
| Width | Auto / stretch | default (full width) |

**Always wrap page sections in `<Container>` and use `<Grid>` + `<Col span={n}>` for column layout.**  
Never hardcode arbitrary paddings or column counts that deviate from this spec.  
On mobile, columns collapse — use `span={{ base: 24, lg: N }}` for responsive spans.

---

## When this applies

- Building or scaffolding any page, section, or component
- Writing CSS, Tailwind, or any styling code
- Proposing layouts, color choices, type scales, or spacing
- Designing component cards, hero sections, navigation, or any visual element

## Core principles to always enforce (from the skill)

- **One dominant visual mass** per composition — do not distribute attention evenly
- **Extreme scale contrast** — monumental display type vs. tiny microtext; no smooth heading/body ladder
- **Large intentional negative space** — empty areas are active structure, not gaps to fill
- **Restrained palette** — ground + dominant mark color + at most one accent; no scattered multicolor
- **Matte flatness** — no glassmorphism, gradients, drop shadows on every layer, bevels, or fake 3D
- **Hard zone boundaries** — rectangular crops, bands, panels, seams, hairline rules
- **Typography as architecture** — heavy grotesque or clean blunt sans-serif for display; tight tracking; let type press edges or crop

## Forbidden by default

No decorative icons as filler, no generic centered hero, no glassmorphism, no gold/marble luxury clichés, no scattered accent colors, no equal-weight layout zones, no rounded corners on everything, no shadows on every element.

Always verify against the full generation checklist in `.cursor/skills/taste.md` before finalizing any design output.
